expected = "Application integration instructions for this fork must describe the available in-process interface and distinguish unavailable upstream transports."
proposal = "Rewrite consensus/spec/abci/client-server.md around the in-process Application API, or clearly archive the socket/gRPC material and point integrators to the supported paxd embedding and current request lifecycle."
